# Copy to .env. Compose reads .env from this directory; .env is gitignored.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Leave a line commented to keep the default. Recreate the stack after a change:
#   docker compose up -d
# `make purge` wipes the gallery and cached captions. Photos and lens models stay.

# Photo folder. Unset uses ~/Pictures (or %USERPROFILE%\Pictures on Windows).
# PHOTOS_DIR=/mnt/nas/library

# Host ports.
# PORT=3000
# LENS_PORT=8100

# Caption at most this many images, in sorted path order. A limited run does
# not drop cached captions for files it never opened.
# PHOTOS_LIMIT=20

# Ignore the caption cache and ask lens again.
# RECAPTION=1

# The sentence half of the hybrid caption. Unset uses local Florence beside RAM++.
# Set both of these to ask Ollama instead. A URL with no /v1 gets one added.
# OLLAMA_URL=http://host.docker.internal:11434
# OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3-vl:8b-instruct

# ComfyUI writes the prose only when COMFYUI_MODEL is set too. A URL alone
# leaves the Ollama vision model in charge.
# COMFYUI_URL=http://host.docker.internal:8188
# COMFYUI_MODEL=joycaption

# Optional rewrite of finished captions. Does not replace Florence unless
# OLLAMA_MODEL is set as well.
# OLLAMA_REFINE_MODEL=qwen3:8b

# Unset is hybrid:ram+florence2, or hybrid:ram+openai-compat when a vision model
# is named above. RAM++ is the tag half either way.
# RAM_VOCAB_PACKS=
# Prose only, with no tags, so Compare stays empty:
# ARGUS_BACKEND=florence2
# ARGUS_BACKEND=openai-compat
# WD14 tags are for a booru or anime checkpoint, not a photoreal one:
# ARGUS_BACKEND=hybrid
# ARGUS_BACKEND=hybrid:wd14+openai-compat
# ARGUS_BACKEND=openai
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Override the cache-file suffix. Unset, it is "ram" plus the model names,
# so a prose-only or WD14 caption is not reused.
# CAPTION_CACHE_KEY=

# Host path to a copy of bake/src/lightbox_bake/facet_lists.example.json.
# Unset uses that example. A missing file does too.
# FACET_LISTS_JSON=./facet_lists.json
